  "description": "A shared utility library providing string manipulation, date/time utilities, encryption helpers, async patterns, reflection extensions, and more -- used across the OASIS, HoloNET, STAR, and all NextGen Software projects. A lightweight, no-frills dependency bringing the full NextGen Software toolkit. Part of the OASIS Omniverse ecosystem at https://oasisomniverse.one -- Source: https://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/NextGenSoftware-Libraries",
